3,1,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! Let's make this office super exciting! I want to know how we start our days and how we've moved around before. I'll check the morning routine upstairs and the unplanned seat shuffles!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I see. I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network. It's important to understand the financial constraints before we decide on a layout.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree that we need a logical approach. I'll look into the sound meter readings and the physio's note from the workstation check to ensure the environment is healthy and productive for everyone.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Since we're prioritizing ""logic,"" let's not forget the human element. I'll look into the physio's note from the workstation check and the sound meter readings. It's better to have the actual data on comfort.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want us all to feel close and happy! I'll check the drawn plan against the staff survey and what this year's two joiners reported. Let's make a place where everyone feels welcome!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Wait, Shion and Mizuki are looking into the same things! Maybe we should spread out more? But if we all agree those are the most important, that's okay too! I'm still super curious about those morning routines!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Overlap isn't necessarily a problem, but efficiency is. If we want a comprehensive view, we should ensure all available data is covered. However, I will stick with my choices to clarify the budget first.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It's fine to overlap if we want a second opinion on the data. However, to be more efficient, I'll switch one. I'll keep the sound meter readings but look into the arrival times in the badge records instead.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is a preference, not a requirement. I'll stick with the physio's note and the sound meter readings. If we want a layout that actually works, we need to prioritize the physical reality of the workspace.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"That's a great point, Shion! I think it's wonderful that we all care so much about our health and comfort. I'll stick with my choices so we can see what our new teammates think too!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm glad we're all thinking about different things! I'll stick with the morning routine and the seat shuffles. I bet there are some funny stories about why people moved before! What do you think, Toshio?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I don't think there are many funny stories in seat shuffles, Rin. Usually, it's just a sign of poor planning. I'll maintain my focus on the billing and the facilities quote.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I think we have a good balance now. By checking the badge records and sound levels, I can help determine if certain spots are naturally more disruptive or isolated, which will be key for a fair layout.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Fair enough. While you all chase patterns and budgets, I'll focus on the tangible. If we ignore the physical toll of a bad desk, no amount of ""fairness"" or ""budgeting"" will make the layout successful.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I totally agree! Everyone's health is so important. I'm just really excited to see how we can make our space feel more like a community. I'll stick with the survey and the joiners' reports!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! We're all set then! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's make sure we share everything so we can build the coolest office ever! I'm ready to start the adventure!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Let's keep our expectations grounded. I look forward to seeing the data, provided it leads to a practical and sustainable decision. I am ready to proceed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm ready as well. Let's ensure that when we share our findings, we don't just look at the averages, but also at who might be disadvantaged by certain placements. I'll see you all in the next round.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I'm ready. Let's see if the data actually supports your ideals, or if it reveals the flaws you're all ignoring. I'll be waiting to see the results.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm ready too! I'm sure all our findings will come together to make something wonderful for everyone. Let's do our best to make this a happy place to work! See you all soon!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
